    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97082" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στραγγίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράγξ</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squeeze out</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στραγγιεῖ τὸ αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			; <i>press, squeeze the water out of</i> crushed olives
			which have been immersed, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				9.32.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεβίνθους στραγγιζομένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hippiatr.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστραγγισμένου τοῦ
			ὕδατος</span> ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρεύγομαι</span>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.511
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				729.50
			</span></i>: 
				Act.
			 in same sense, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.351
			</span></i>.</div>
